// ---- Per-character AI skill (g_survivalDifficulty easy/hard tiers) ----
//
// Used by BG_SetBehaviorForSurvival for the 6 characters below only - every
// other character (Partisan, all zombie-types) is fixed at max skill in code
// and ignores g_survivalDifficulty entirely.
//
// Each wave: delta = rawSteps * 0.05. aim_skill/aim_accuracy/attack_skill all
// move together (same base/cap) in every default below, but are still 3
// independently overridable fields if you want to split them apart.
// *_base + delta, capped at *_cap (reaction_time_base - delta, floored at
// reaction_time_floor, since faster reaction is a smaller number).
//
// Key shape: <charname>.easy_<field> / <charname>.hard_<field> value

soldier.easy_aim_skill_base        0.1
soldier.easy_aim_skill_cap         0.7
soldier.easy_aim_accuracy_base     0.1
soldier.easy_aim_accuracy_cap      0.7
soldier.easy_attack_skill_base     0.1
soldier.easy_attack_skill_cap      0.7
soldier.easy_aggression_base       0.1
soldier.easy_aggression_cap        1.0
soldier.easy_reaction_time_base    1.0
soldier.easy_reaction_time_floor   0.4
soldier.hard_aim_skill_base        0.4
soldier.hard_aim_skill_cap         0.8
soldier.hard_aim_accuracy_base     0.4
soldier.hard_aim_accuracy_cap      0.8
soldier.hard_attack_skill_base     0.4
soldier.hard_attack_skill_cap      0.8
soldier.hard_aggression_base       0.4
soldier.hard_aggression_cap        1.0
soldier.hard_reaction_time_base    0.8
soldier.hard_reaction_time_floor   0.4

